codex
The answers select candidate A: double urgency when confidence is below 0.4. Do not cap the result at 1. Keep the current rule at confidence 0.4 and above. I also confirmed the earlier edits: ignore anger, add 20 to the EU score, and escalate critical-tier alerts when error rate exceeds 0.7.
